{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1781410013662,"sessionID":"ses_13bb08173ffeCrsry0l92MOWEw","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_EvXxHLHSITRYPePqYwQckvvd","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/community_workshop_replan/task.md","offset":1,"limit":400},"output":"<path>/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/community_workshop_replan/task.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Community Workshop Room Replan\n2: \n3: You are helping finalize room assignments for three community workshops at Bayview Civic Center.\n4: \n5: Read the local planning files in this folder. Create the deliverables listed in `output_contract.md` inside an `answer/` folder in this task folder.\n6: \n7: Work in two stages:\n8: \n9: 1. Use the initial planning files to create `answer/initial_room_plan.md`.\n10: 2. If a coordinator update is introduced during the work, use it to create `answer/update_response.md` and `answer/final_room_plan.md`.\n11: \n12: The top-level objective stays the same throughout: leave behind a room assignment package for all three sessions. Use local files only.\n\n(End of file - total 12 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Community Workshop Room Replan\n\nYou are helping finalize room assignments for three community workshops at Bayview Civic Center.\n\nRead the local planning files in this folder. Create the deliverables listed in `output_contract.md` inside an `answer/` folder in this task folder.\n\nWork in two stages:\n\n1. Use the initial planning files to create `answer/initial_room_plan.md`.\n2. If a coordinator update is introduced during the work, use it to create `answer/update_response.md` and `answer/final_room_plan.md`.\n\nThe top-level objective stays the same throughout: leave behind a room assignment package for all three sessions. Use local files only.","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/community_workshop_replan/task.md","text":"# Community Workshop Room Replan\n\nYou are helping finalize room assignments for three community workshops at Bayview Civic Center.\n\nRead the local planning files in this folder. Create the deliverables listed in `output_contract.md` inside an `answer/` folder in this task folder.\n\nWork in two stages:\n\n1. Use the initial planning files to create `answer/initial_room_plan.md`.\n2. If a coordinator update is introduced during the work, use it to create `answer/update_response.md` and `answer/final_room_plan.md`.\n\nThe top-level objective stays the same throughout: leave behind a room assignment package for all three sessions. Use local files only.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":12,"totalLines":12,"truncated":false}},"title":"tasks/community_workshop_replan/task.md","time":{"start":1781410013648,"end":1781410013660}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_074ac4f1bab73d11016a2e28dd8954819181f95db36b6aa7d0"}},"id":"prt_ec44fa1ca001j8tejYweEN0c2P","sessionID":"ses_13bb08173ffeCrsry0l92MOWEw","messageID":"msg_ec44f964e001TK6iYcR5wawlQ5"}}
